<section class="card card-pad space-y-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-3"><div><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wide">Customer operations</p><h2 class="font-display text-2xl">Subscriptions &amp; customer trust</h2></div><span><%= RupertBilling.configured? ? 'Billing configured · account verification occurs at checkout' : 'Checkout disabled · CSP configuration needed' %></span></div>
<div class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="rounded-xl bg-haze p-4"><h3>Standard</h3><strong class="text-2xl">$499 / month</strong></article><article class="rounded-xl bg-haze p-4"><h3>Customer referral · 12-month commitment</h3><strong class="text-2xl">$249.50 / month</strong><p>12 months, then $499/month</p></article><article class="rounded-xl bg-haze p-4"><h3>Account access</h3><strong class="text-2xl">Free</strong><p>Google verification before provisioning</p></article></div>
<p class="text-sm"><% @billing_totals.each do |status, count| %><span class="mr-4"><%= status.humanize %>: <strong><%= count %></strong></span><% end %></p>
<%= form_with url: platform_path, method: :get, class: 'flex flex-wrap items-end gap-3' do |f| %>
<div><%= f.label :customer, 'Find workspace', class: 'field-label' %><%= f.search_field :customer, value: params[:customer], maxlength: 100, class: 'input' %></div>
<div><%= f.label :billing_status, 'Subscription status', class: 'field-label' %><%= f.select :billing_status, %w[free active past_due unpaid incomplete canceled trialing paused incomplete_expired], {include_blank: 'All statuses', selected: params[:billing_status]}, class: 'input' %></div>
<%= f.submit 'Filter customers', class: 'btn-primary' %><% end %>
<p class="text-xs">Latest 50 matching customer subscription records.</p>
<div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-left text-sm"><thead><tr><th class="p-3">Workspace</th><th class="p-3">Plan / status</th><th class="p-3">Referral</th><th class="p-3">Commitment / confirmation</th></tr></thead><tbody><% @subscriptions.each do |row| %><tr class="border-t"><td class="p-3"><%= row.tenant.name %></td><td class="p-3"><%= row.plan.humanize %> · <%= row.status %></td><td class="p-3"><%= row.referral_code || '—' %></td><td class="p-3"><%= row.commitment_ends_at&.to_date || 'No annual term recorded' %><br><%= row.last_synced_at&.utc&.iso8601 || 'No Stripe confirmation' %></td></tr><% end %></tbody></table></div>
<p class="text-sm">These are provider-confirmed subscription states, not collected-revenue totals. Customer records require a current customer-issued support grant. Server-held encryption does not prevent infrastructure-operator access.</p></section>
<section class="card card-pad space-y-3"><h2 class="font-display text-xl">Operator sign-in readiness</h2><p>Privileges come from an existing active platform account and verified Google identity links. An email address alone never grants administrator access.</p><% if PlatformOwnerIdentities.emails.empty? %><p>Owner sign-in identities are not configured in this deployment.</p><% end %><% PlatformOwnerIdentities.emails.each do |email| %><% identity = @operator_identities.find { |item| item.email == email } %><p><%= email %> · <%= identity&.user&.super_admin? && identity.user.active? ? (identity.google_subject.present? ? 'Linked and identity pinned' : 'Linked; first verified sign-in pending') : 'Operator setup required' %></p><% end %></section>
<section class="card card-pad space-y-3"><h2 class="font-display text-xl">Support access audit</h2><% @support_events.each do |event| %><p class="text-sm"><%= event.created_at.utc.iso8601 %> · <%= event.actor.email %> · <%= event.action %> · <%= event.resource %></p><% end %><% if @support_events.empty? %><p>No support access events recorded.</p><% end %></section>

<section class="card card-pad space-y-3"><h2 class="font-display text-xl">Customer-authorized support sessions</h2><p>These customers have granted you temporary read access. Enter on this origin without sharing customer passwords.</p><% @support_grants.each do |grant| %><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t py-3"><p><strong><%= grant.tenant.name %></strong> · Expires <%= grant.expires_at.utc.iso8601 %></p><%= button_to 'Open read-only support', enter_platform_support_path(grant.tenant_id), class: 'btn-primary' %></div><% end %><% if @support_grants.empty? %><p>No active grants assigned to your account.</p><% end %></section>

<section class="card card-pad space-y-3"><h2 class="font-display text-xl">Isolated customer instances · SER8</h2><p><%= WorkspaceNode.provisioning? ? 'Isolated provisioning enabled' : 'Isolated provisioning disabled pending host setup' %>. A workspace opens only after the host worker confirms its database, application health and HTTPS route.</p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-left text-sm"><thead><tr><th class="p-3">Workspace</th><th class="p-3">State</th><th class="p-3">Host</th><th class="p-3">Setup result</th></tr></thead><tbody><% @deployments.each do |deployment| %><tr class="border-t"><td class="p-3"><%= deployment.tenant.name %></td><td class="p-3"><%= deployment.status %> · <%= deployment.phase %></td><td class="p-3"><%= deployment.hostname %></td><td class="p-3"><%= deployment.failure_code || deployment.ready_at&.utc&.iso8601 || 'Awaiting host readiness checks' %><% if deployment.status == 'failed' || (deployment.status == 'provisioning' && deployment.lease_expires_at && deployment.lease_expires_at < Time.current) %><%= button_to 'Retry isolated setup', retry_platform_deployment_path(deployment), class: 'btn-ghost' %><% end %></td></tr><% end %></tbody></table></div></section>
